WEBVTT

00:07.920 --> 00:10.210
Maybe you're not actually a dog...

00:10.210 --> 00:11.880
but a real person?

00:13.040 --> 00:14.170
She knows?!

00:26.290 --> 00:27.790
Guess I'm going, too!

00:30.040 --> 00:33.040
Oh, right, they're coming after her
'cause she smells like hot dogs!

00:33.040 --> 00:34.670
Hiding doesn't help!

00:34.670 --> 00:36.040
Fine, then!

00:43.790 --> 00:47.790
I gotta do something to get Nekotani
to smell less like a sausage party!

00:50.420 --> 00:53.380
Yosomi shinaide onrii wan na good boy

00:53.380 --> 00:56.540
Kimi to ireba wandafuru ranran raifu

00:56.540 --> 00:59.630
One, two, three de jump! Aijou atenshon

00:59.630 --> 01:02.710
Three, two, one de turn! Kitai ijou supaaku

01:02.710 --> 01:05.880
One to one de love! Gyakkyou furakushon

01:05.880 --> 01:09.000
Asa kara ban made wandafuru ni saabisu

01:09.000 --> 01:12.080
Daisuki datte tsutawatte little boy

01:12.080 --> 01:15.670
Aishite! Aishite! Aisasete I want you

01:16.210 --> 01:22.000
Boku o ikiro kanzen nenshou hashirinukero

01:22.000 --> 01:28.670
Gooru wa atarashii jibun sa
(Go Beyond Yourself!)

01:28.670 --> 01:34.460
Takaku hoero manshinsoui na kinou koete

01:34.460 --> 01:37.500
Ashita no (aijou atenshon)
bokura no (gyakkyou furakushon)

01:37.500 --> 01:41.710
Seiippai kagayaiteru

01:41.710 --> 01:43.210
This is your life, your way!

01:43.330 --> 01:44.880
This is my life, my way!

01:45.000 --> 01:45.880
Wan!

01:49.540 --> 01:55.000
Pochita.

01:51.960 --> 01:54.130
Go away!

01:54.130 --> 01:56.750
I don't wanna get bitten!

01:59.920 --> 02:03.540
Okay, let's get her to go to the pool!

02:04.290 --> 02:07.420
I'll use her ear as a steering wheel!

02:14.420 --> 02:16.250
Good, she went right!

02:16.830 --> 02:18.500
Right ear's up next!

02:19.210 --> 02:20.540
Turn left!

02:20.540 --> 02:22.460
Stop it!

02:23.830 --> 02:27.290
Perfect! Now we just gotta avoid
any other students...

02:28.960 --> 02:30.460
...and get in the pool!

02:32.670 --> 02:35.830
Run like the wind!

02:46.880 --> 02:48.710
Where's Nekotani?!

02:57.380 --> 02:59.540
Nowhere I look is safe!

03:08.460 --> 03:12.710
She doesn't smell anymore,
so the dogs are heading back...

03:17.210 --> 03:20.670
Did you... save me again, Pochita-kun?

03:21.920 --> 03:25.630
You're seriously just as smart as we are.

03:26.790 --> 03:29.880
Crap, if she finds out I'm human,

03:29.880 --> 03:32.830
I'm gonna have to apologize
for perving out on her...

03:35.040 --> 03:36.630
You're one smart dog.

03:43.670 --> 03:46.210
I went to get something to
wipe off a bit of glue,

03:46.210 --> 03:48.580
not towel off after a swim.

03:49.420 --> 03:53.960
Oh, well... Shit got kinda crazy, so...

03:54.500 --> 03:57.330
And why is Pochita wet, too?

03:57.330 --> 04:00.290
C-calm your tits, Karen!

04:00.580 --> 04:01.710
My God...

04:01.710 --> 04:05.000
Did you take him into the pool
to get wet and wild with him?!

04:05.000 --> 04:08.130
I told you; I fell in!

04:08.380 --> 04:12.710
Pochita jumped in to rescue me!

04:12.710 --> 04:15.380
I-isn't that right, Pochita?

04:15.710 --> 04:20.380
I mean, no, it's not, but I'll back her up.

04:21.750 --> 04:24.880
See? Pochita wouldn't lie to you!

04:28.540 --> 04:30.290
Fine, whatever.

04:31.000 --> 04:35.170
You're gonna catch a cold
if you don't dry off, though.

04:35.460 --> 04:40.830
Get those wet clothes off
and change into your gym clothes.

04:44.880 --> 04:49.210
Man, you could at least show some emotion...

05:00.580 --> 05:02.920
I'm totally soaked.

05:11.130 --> 05:14.750
It's so hard to get them off like this...

05:24.290 --> 05:27.130
Even my panties are wrecked...

05:29.790 --> 05:32.670
Whoa, whoa, Nekotani?!

05:32.670 --> 05:35.420
I know I'm just a dog, but I still have eyes!

05:35.420 --> 05:38.210
Not that I should be looking, dammit!

05:42.420 --> 05:44.080
I'm not looking!

05:44.080 --> 05:46.830
I'm not looking! I'm not looking!
I'm not looking!

05:46.830 --> 05:48.210
I'm not-

05:49.290 --> 05:52.920
Pochita, stay still so I can dry you off.

05:52.920 --> 05:57.170
Wait! Stop! I wasn't looking, Inukai-san!

06:04.080 --> 06:07.580
Dry your hair, too, or you'll get sick.

06:08.040 --> 06:09.920
Wipe it down like this.

06:10.750 --> 06:11.830
What?

06:13.170 --> 06:14.380
Thanks.

06:16.540 --> 06:19.960
Guess I'm stuck like this
till my uniform dries.

06:22.250 --> 06:23.750
Ugh.

06:30.380 --> 06:31.630
C'mon.

06:34.670 --> 06:36.750
This brings back memories.

06:36.750 --> 06:42.460
You used to play with my hair
all the time when we were little.

06:43.040 --> 06:44.330
Inukai-san...

06:49.710 --> 06:54.460
Did you make that? It looks good, Karen!

06:58.250 --> 07:00.210
I'm gonna remake it.

07:00.210 --> 07:04.500
Huh?! I said it looks good, like,
for something you made!

07:06.460 --> 07:10.790
The old Pochita could make Inukai-san smile.

07:19.790 --> 07:22.170
Okay, I've got it.

07:43.250 --> 07:45.750
You put little pawprints on it?

07:45.750 --> 07:47.880
That's so cute!

07:47.880 --> 07:49.380
Right, Karen?

07:52.670 --> 07:58.250
Welcome to our Dog Café!

07:53.080 --> 07:55.750
Okay, how's it going, guys?

07:55.750 --> 07:58.250
Can we come together for a sec?

07:58.790 --> 08:01.330
Inu... Inukai-san?!

08:01.330 --> 08:02.830
Everything okay?

08:02.830 --> 08:06.250
So... the rings...

08:06.540 --> 08:09.420
Rings? Oh, the San paper rings!

08:09.420 --> 08:11.960
You don't have to bother with these!

08:11.960 --> 08:14.580
Let us handle the annoying stuff.

08:15.210 --> 08:17.250
Oh... Okay.

08:18.790 --> 08:21.790
I always thought she wasn't interested
in being friends with anyone.

08:21.790 --> 08:23.710
But that's not it.

08:23.710 --> 08:26.790
She just doesn't know how to talk to people.

08:29.630 --> 08:33.330
She stopped smiling when she lost Pochita.

08:33.880 --> 08:37.290
Now everyone thinks she's mean,
or is scared of her...

08:37.750 --> 08:40.880
So, she needs me to be that Pochita again!

08:48.830 --> 08:51.880
Wait, did you make this, Inukai-san?

08:51.880 --> 08:55.130
Look at the pawprints! That's so cute!

08:55.580 --> 08:58.040
It's perfect for our dog café!

08:58.580 --> 09:00.960
Hey, guys, let's all put
pawprints on the rings!

09:00.960 --> 09:02.670
Yeah!

09:03.830 --> 09:05.380
Thanks!

09:05.380 --> 09:09.500
And I'm so sorry, Inukai-san.
You must've worked hard on these!

09:11.000 --> 09:12.380
Yeah.

09:12.920 --> 09:15.630
It's seriously so cute, Inukai-san.

09:15.630 --> 09:17.040
Nice idea!

09:17.040 --> 09:20.580
You've got a knack for this, huh?

09:21.130 --> 09:24.000
I didn't do anything...

09:24.000 --> 09:26.000
It was all Pochita.

09:28.790 --> 09:33.080
I haven't seen that embarrassed look
on your face in a while.

09:34.080 --> 09:36.500
Thanks, Pochita-kun.

09:36.830 --> 09:40.290
You really do remind me of the old Pochita.

09:40.750 --> 09:44.710
Pochita was so important to Inukai-san.

09:44.710 --> 09:49.960
So, what will happen to Inukai-san
when her new Pochita disappears...?

09:55.080 --> 10:00.170
I've missed you, Senpai!

10:01.130 --> 10:03.130
Tsukishiro?

10:03.960 --> 10:06.460
What the hell are you wearing?!

10:06.880 --> 10:12.000
Oh, our class is doing a bunny cafe!

10:12.580 --> 10:18.880
Senpai's a little perv, so I figured
he'd wanna see me in this cute outfit.

10:20.580 --> 10:21.790
I see.

10:23.170 --> 10:25.880
Pochita loves looking at big boobs,

10:25.880 --> 10:27.580
getting into a girl's panties,

10:27.580 --> 10:29.880
and other lewd activities.

10:29.880 --> 10:33.080
Inukai-san!

10:33.500 --> 10:35.130
I know, right?

10:36.420 --> 10:39.750
Inukai-senpai, want to have
another little duel?

10:39.750 --> 10:42.460
If my class raises the most money,

10:42.460 --> 10:45.500
I get a whole day to do
whatever I want with Senpai!

10:45.500 --> 10:47.000
Uh, what?!

10:47.880 --> 10:53.420
Fine. If my class wins, you'll never
bother my Pochita ever again.

10:53.750 --> 10:54.880
Huh?

10:57.330 --> 10:59.540
Sounds good to me.

10:59.540 --> 11:01.580
You're on!

11:07.540 --> 11:11.290
Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu!

11:12.330 --> 11:14.920
Hausu! Hausu! Hausu! Hausu!

11:14.920 --> 11:17.170
Let's go mai hausu!

11:17.330 --> 11:21.750
Airashii sono sugata ni sukitte sukitte tomaranai

11:21.750 --> 11:26.920
Watashi ga katte shiawase ni
suru kara kocchi oide yo

11:26.920 --> 11:31.040
Kyawakyawa chu chu chu himitsu no hitotoki wa

11:31.420 --> 11:36.080
Suki na mono ni massugu fureaeru daiji na jikan

11:36.460 --> 11:38.630
Shitawatteru kono kimochi

11:39.000 --> 11:41.000
Kakushiteta kono kimochi

11:41.540 --> 11:43.380
Mitsuketa kono kimochi

11:43.380 --> 11:45.040
Todoke! Todoke!

11:45.040 --> 11:47.040
Da-da-da-da-da-da-da daisuki!

11:47.040 --> 11:50.750
Kataomoi kimi ni kitto tsutawarimasu you ni

11:50.920 --> 11:55.130
Sono shigai kara miageta watashi ga itsuka

11:55.130 --> 11:57.670
Kimi no numbaa wan ni naritai

11:57.670 --> 12:00.540
Kokoro no soko kara I love you!
